The inspiration for me joining Hololive...

983
01:00:00,643 --> 01:00:01,843
…っかけになった
...became the catalyst...

984
01:00:01,843 --> 01:00:04,443
曲がございますのじゃ。
There is a song that served as the catalyst.

985
01:00:06,643 --> 01:00:08,043
わしが…
For me...

986
01:00:08,043 --> 01:00:09,843
ホロライブに…
...with Hololive...

987
01:00:11,143 --> 01:00:13,343
『ホロライブ言えるかな』…
"Can You Do the Hololive?"...

988
01:00:13,643 --> 01:00:17,443
歌枠の最後に『ホロライブ言えるかな』歌い出したら超おもろいけどね。
It'd be hilarious if I started singing "Can You Do the Hololive?" at the end of a singing stream, though.

989
01:00:17,443 --> 01:00:21,143
超おもろいけどね、「ほーら みんなで」って歌い出したら超おもろいけどね。
Super hilarious. If I suddenly started singing, "Come on, everybody!"

990
01:00:21,643 --> 01:00:22,643
はい！
Alright!

991
01:00:23,243 --> 01:00:24,643
ということで、
And so,

992
01:00:24,643 --> 01:00:26,443
最後の曲！
our final song!

993
01:00:26,443 --> 01:00:28,143
最後の曲は、
The final song is...

994
01:00:28,143 --> 01:00:31,043
『Our Bright Parade』。
"Our Bright Parade."

995
01:00:31,443 --> 01:00:34,043
歌わせていただこうと、
I thought I'd sing it...

996
01:00:35,143 --> 01:00:37,643
歌わせていただこうと、
...I thought I would sing it,

997
01:00:38,043 --> 01:00:40,243
思いますのじゃ。
that's what I'm thinking.

998
01:00:42,143 --> 01:00:45,143
初配信でもお伝えしたとおり、
As I mentioned in my debut stream as well,

999
01:00:45,443 --> 01:00:47,943
あの、わし、kemuさんが好きで、
um, I really love kemu-san,

1000
01:00:47,943 --> 01:00:50,643
ボカロP…ボカロがすっごい好きで、
Vocaloid P... I love Vocaloid so much,

1001
01:00:50,643 --> 01:00:53,643
ボカロPさんの提供曲を聴くのがすごい好きなんじゃが、
and I love listening to songs provided by Vocaloid producers,

1002
01:00:53,943 --> 01:00:57,143
その中でも、そのkemuさんっていうね、ボカロPさんがいらっしゃって、
and among them is a Vocaloid producer known as kemu-san,

1003
01:00:57,143 --> 01:00:59,143
堀江晶太さんっていう方がいらっしゃるんじゃが、
who also goes by Shota Horie-san.

1004
01:00:59,443 --> 01:01:04,143
堀江晶太さんの提供曲をね、漁っていた時期があったのじゃ。
There was a time when I was digging through songs composed by Shota Horie-san.

1005
01:01:04,443 --> 01:01:07,143
漁っていたときに、
And while I was digging through them,

1006
01:01:07,143 --> 01:01:10,143
その曲の中に『Our Bright Parade』という曲がね、
among those songs, there was one called "Our Bright Parade"...

1007
01:01:10,443 --> 01:01:12,443
あって。
...and so,

1008
01:01:12,643 --> 01:01:14,643
そう、それを見つけて、
yeah, when I found it...

1009
01:01:14,643 --> 01:01:17,643
聴いたときに、涙が出たのじゃ。
...and listened to it, tears came to my eyes.

1010
01:01:17,943 --> 01:01:20,443
この曲に呼ばれたって、
"This song called out to me,"

1011
01:01:20,443 --> 01:01:22,443
思ったのじゃ。
is what I felt.

1012
01:01:25,843 --> 01:01:28,143
だから、すごいわしにとって、
So, for me,

1013
01:01:28,143 --> 01:01:31,443
思い入れがある曲を、
a song that holds so many personal memories...

1014
01:01:32,143 --> 01:01:35,143
初めての歌枠で、
...in my very first singing stream,

1015
01:01:35,143 --> 01:01:37,643
歌わせていただこうと思って、
I wanted to sing it,

1016
01:01:39,443 --> 01:01:41,443
歌わせていただきたいと、
I felt that I really wanted to sing it,

1017
01:01:41,443 --> 01:01:43,143
思いますのじゃ。
and that's how I feel.

1018
01:01:45,443 --> 01:01:47,643
大切な曲なのじゃ。
It's a truly precious song to me.

1019
01:01:47,643 --> 01:01:50,643
いい曲ね、いっぱいあるんじゃけど、
There are so many wonderful songs, but...

1020
01:01:50,643 --> 01:01:55,243
やっぱね、思い出補正みたいなのもあって。
...there's also that nostalgia filter and personal connection.

1021
01:01:57,443 --> 01:01:59,643
そう、いい曲いっぱいあるけど、
Yeah, there are lots of great songs, but...

1022
01:01:59,643 --> 01:02:04,143
中でも、中でも好きな曲なのじゃ。
...among them all, it's one of my absolute favorites.

1023
01:02:07,643 --> 01:02:09,143
のじゃ。
Yes, indeed.

1024
01:02:09,443 --> 01:02:12,443
ちょっと緊張するんじゃが、緊張するんじゃが、
I'm a bit nervous... I really am, but...

1025
01:02:12,443 --> 01:02:14,443
歌わせていただくのじゃ。
...I'm going to sing it for you.

1026
01:02:15,143 --> 01:02:17,443
お主らは、お主らは、
Everyone, everyone,

1027
01:02:17,443 --> 01:02:21,143
高評価ボタンを押して応援してほしいですのじゃ。
I'd love for you to hit the like button and support me!

1028
01:02:21,443 --> 01:02:23,143
がんばれーますのじゃ…
I'll do my best-ish...

1029
01:02:23,143 --> 01:02:25,243
がんばりますのじゃ。
I'll do my absolute best!

1030
01:02:28,643 --> 01:02:30,443
よいしょ。
Alright.

1031
01:02:30,643 --> 01:02:34,143
それでは、歌っちゃおうかな。
Now then, shall I start singing?

1032
01:02:34,143 --> 01:02:35,643
よいしょ。
Here we go.

1033
01:02:36,443 --> 01:02:37,643
のじゃ。
Yes.

1034
01:02:37,643 --> 01:02:41,443
それでは！歌わせていただきますのじゃ！
Here we go! Please listen to my song!

1035
01:02:42,143 --> 01:02:43,643
よいしょ。
Here we go.

1036
01:02:46,143 --> 01:02:48,643
『Our Bright Parade』。
"Our Bright Parade."

1037
01:02:57,643 --> 01:03:01,143
Parade, Parade, Parade!

1038
01:03:01,143 --> 01:03:04,143
輝くんだよ
We're going to shine!

1039
01:03:04,143 --> 01:03:09,143
呼び合う声を合図に
With our calling voices as the signal,

1040
01:03:09,143 --> 01:03:13,643
Parade, Parade, Parade!

1041
01:03:13,643 --> 01:03:17,443
探しにゆく
We go searching,

1042
01:03:17,443 --> 01:03:23,643
スタートは何度だって
for as many new starts as it takes.

1043
01:03:35,143 --> 01:03:37,643
これが今日最後の曲ですのじゃ！
This is the last song for today!

1044
01:03:37,643 --> 01:03:40,643
ホロライブに入って一週間、
It's been one week since I joined Hololive,

1045
01:03:40,643 --> 01:03:44,143
これからもがんばりますのじゃ！
and I'll keep doing my best going forward!

1046
01:03:44,843 --> 01:03:49,643
ただ 独り言 綴った
I just penned down my soliloquy,

1047
01:03:49,643 --> 01:03:54,443
ただ 始まりたくて 走った
I just ran, wanting a new beginning.

1048
01:03:54,643 --> 01:03:59,443
遠く 暗がりに灯った
Lit far away in the darkness,

1049
01:03:59,443 --> 01:04:04,143
それは 眩し過ぎた名前
was a name that was far too dazzling.

1050
01:04:04,143 --> 01:04:09,443
それは 優し過ぎる思い出もっと
Those memories that were far too kind,

1051
01:04:09,443 --> 01:04:13,443
近づけと手を伸ばした
I reached out my hand to get closer.

1052
01:04:13,443 --> 01:04:15,643
思いがけず 結び合った
Unexpectedly, they intertwined,

1053
01:04:15,643 --> 01:04:17,643
ほら 今 迷子は
look, now the lost child...

1054
01:04:17,643 --> 01:04:20,143
“僕等”になった
...became "us!"

1055
01:04:20,143 --> 01:04:23,143
Parade, Parade, Parade!

1056
01:04:23,143 --> 01:04:26,143
輝くんだよ
We're going to shine!

1057
01:04:26,143 --> 01:04:31,143
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
Bring along your frustration and your love too!

1058
01:04:31,143 --> 01:04:35,643
風、夢、羽、飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, wings—we can soar!

1059
01:04:35,643 --> 01:04:39,443
ささやかな祈りは光
A modest prayer turns into light,

1060
01:04:39,443 --> 01:04:41,843
終わりなき日差し
an endless beam of sunlight.

1061
01:04:41,843 --> 01:04:44,243
君を見つけたこと
Finding you...

1062
01:04:44,243 --> 01:04:46,843
胸を張れるよ
...is something I can be proud of!

1063
01:04:46,843 --> 01:04:49,643
ここから これから
From here on, from now on,

1064
01:04:49,643 --> 01:04:54,643
Our Bright Parade, Parade!

1065
01:05:00,943 --> 01:05:01,843
まだ…
Still...

1066
01:05:02,351 --> 01:05:05,651
まだ頼りない予感を
Still holding onto this faint anticipation,

1067
01:05:05,751 --> 01:05:10,651
歌おう 恥ずかしくなんてないよ
let's sing it, there's nothing to be ashamed of.

1068
01:05:10,851 --> 01:05:15,651
誰も解けない イマジナリー
An imaginary world no one can unravel,

1069
01:05:15,751 --> 01:05:21,551
いつかまた逢える おまじない
a charm so that we can meet again someday.

1070
01:05:21,751 --> 01:05:26,951
あの日 ゼロに始まった ストーリー
The story that began from zero on that day,

1071
01:05:27,151 --> 01:05:32,151
数え切れない言の葉 数えるような想いじゃないさ
countless words, not feelings you can simply count.

1072
01:05:32,251 --> 01:05:37,451
ほら 今 僕らを一つと呼ぼう
Look, right now, let's call all of us one!

1073
01:05:37,551 --> 01:05:41,751
Parade, Parade, Parade! 美しいんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! It's so beautiful!

1074
01:05:41,951 --> 01:05:47,951
許し合える刹那 夜はきらめく
In this moment of mutual forgiveness, the night sparkles.

1075
01:05:48,151 --> 01:05:52,651
雨、晴れ、カレイド またとなき空
Rain, sunshine, kaleidoscope—this once-in-a-lifetime sky.

1076
01:05:52,851 --> 01:05:59,651
相応しい旅路とは 君と在ることさ
The journey that suits us is simply being with you...

1077
01:06:00,851 --> 01:06:05,651
君と在ることなんだ
...yes, it's being right here with you!

1078
01:06:06,151 --> 01:06:11,651
“ただいま”を聞けば “おかえり”って叫ぶよ
When I hear "I'm home," I'll shout back "Welcome back!"

1079
01:06:12,651 --> 01:06:18,151
当たり前じゃないか
Isn't that only natural?

1080
01:06:18,351 --> 01:06:23,151
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! Shine bright!

1081
01:06:23,351 --> 01:06:30,651
暗がりを満たすのは 君だ 僕だ！
The ones who fill the darkness are you, and me!

1082
01:06:30,951 --> 01:06:35,651
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! Shine bright!

1083
01:06:35,851 --> 01:06:41,651
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
Bring your regrets, and bring your love along!

1084
01:06:41,851 --> 01:06:45,951
風、夢、羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, wings—we can take flight!

1085
01:06:46,151 --> 01:06:51,951
ささやかな祈りは光 終わりなき兆し
A humble prayer is light, a never-ending sign.

1086
01:06:52,151 --> 01:06:56,951
君と飛び込んでゆく 素敵なスタートさ
Diving in together with you, what a wonderful start!

1087
01:06:57,051 --> 01:07:03,151
ここから これから Our Bright Parade, Parade!
From here on, from now on, Our Bright Parade, Parade!

1088
01:07:03,951 --> 01:07:09,651
Our Bright Parade, Parade

1089
01:07:16,151 --> 01:07:19,151
のじゃ〜〜
Noja~~!

1090
01:07:22,751 --> 01:07:27,651
ああー…なんか感動しちゃうのじゃ。
Ahh... somehow, I feel so moved.

1091
01:07:27,951 --> 01:07:30,651
なんか感動しちゃうのじゃ。
I'm really getting emotional.

1092
01:07:32,151 --> 01:07:35,651
なんか…わしが…
Like... to think that I...

1093
01:07:37,451 --> 01:07:41,151
わし…画面の前にいたのに…
I was just in front of the screen watching, but...

1094
01:07:43,651 --> 01:07:47,151
わし画面の前にいたのに…
I was just someone watching in front of a screen, but...

1095
01:07:47,651 --> 01:07:54,651
もしかしてこれから先、3Dになったりしたら…
what if, in the future, when I get a 3D model...

1096
01:07:55,751 --> 01:08:03,651
お主らの前でリアルのライブとかで歌えちゃったりするんじゃろうか。
I might actually get to sing right in front of you all at a real live concert?

1097
01:08:08,151 --> 01:08:11,651
なんか…いつか…
Like... someday...

1098
01:08:13,951 --> 01:08:18,551
いつかわしがステージに立ってのう、
Someday, when I stand on stage,

1099
01:08:18,951 --> 01:08:22,651
ステージに立ってのう、それでのお、
stand on that stage, and then...

1100
01:08:22,951 --> 01:08:28,651
それを見たお主らの中から、かつてのわしみたいに、
maybe among you watching me, just like I once did,

1101
01:08:28,651 --> 01:08:33,651
ホロライブに憧れる人が出ちゃったりするんじゃろうか。
someone might end up looking up to Hololive too?

1102
01:08:35,951 --> 01:08:40,351
まだまだめちゃくちゃほやほやの新米じゃけど、
I'm still such a brand-new, fresh rookie, but...

1103
01:08:40,651 --> 01:08:42,151
ね？
right?

1104
01:08:42,951 --> 01:08:49,651
そういうね、わしに憧れる子がもしかして出ちゃうかも、出てきちゃうかもしれないのじゃ。
Someone who looks up to me might actually come along, someone like that might appear!

1105
01:08:49,951 --> 01:08:53,151
それってすごいことなのじゃ。
That would be such an incredible thing!

1106
01:08:53,951 --> 01:08:56,951
それってすごいことですのじゃ。
That truly is such an amazing thing.

1107
01:08:58,951 --> 01:09:01,951
それってすごいことなのじゃ。
That's really something incredible.

1108
01:09:03,951 --> 01:09:07,651
ええー…すごいことなのじゃ。
Wow... that's such an amazing thought.

1109
01:09:09,951 --> 01:09:13,351
まだわしデビューして1週間なのに…
Even though it's only been one week since my debut...

1110
01:09:15,351 --> 01:09:16,951
うん。
Yeah.

1111
01:09:17,951 --> 01:09:20,351
すごいことなのじゃ。
It's truly amazing.

1112
01:09:22,651 --> 01:09:24,151
ねえ？
Right?

1113
01:09:26,551 --> 01:09:31,651
不思議な話。運命みたいなのじゃ、なんか。
It's so mysterious. It almost feels like destiny, somehow.

1114
01:09:31,951 --> 01:09:33,151
うん。
Yeah.

1115
01:09:33,751 --> 01:09:35,151
のじゃ。
Indeed.

1116
01:09:35,951 --> 01:09:39,151
ね、わしが「僕ら」になった。
You know, "I" became part of "us."

1117
01:09:39,951 --> 01:09:42,351
ええー…
Wow...

1118
01:09:42,951 --> 01:09:45,751
すごいことなのじゃ〜。
It's such an incredible thing...

1119
01:09:46,151 --> 01:09:48,551
嬉しいのじゃ。
I'm so happy.

1120
01:09:49,451 --> 01:09:52,151
すごい嬉しいのじゃ。
I'm really so very happy.

1121
01:09:52,551 --> 01:09:53,651
うん。
Yeah.

1122
01:09:53,951 --> 01:09:55,751
今こうやって…
And now, like this...

1123
01:09:55,951 --> 01:10:00,951
ね、リアルタイムで…アーカイブでもきっと見てる人もたくさんいるじゃろうし、
you know, in real time... and I'm sure lots of people are watching the archive too,

1124
01:10:00,951 --> 01:10:03,651
いっぱいの人が見てくれて、わしのこととか…
with so many people watching me and everything...

1125
01:10:04,989 --> 01:10:08,039
あそびまわり隊のことをね 応援してくれて...
For supporting Asobi Mawaritai...

1126
01:10:09,239 --> 01:10:11,939
まだ だってわしたち出会って一週間じゃよ？
I mean, it's only been a week since we met!

1127
01:10:13,139 --> 01:10:16,939
まだ一週間なのにさ まだ一週間なのにさ
Even though it's only been a week... Even though it's just been one week,

1128
01:10:17,339 --> 01:10:21,639
わしたちのことをさ 応援してくれる人 こんなにいっぱいいる！
there are already so many people cheering us on!

1129
01:10:21,939 --> 01:10:24,139
すごい嬉しいのじゃ
I'm so very happy.

1130
01:10:24,639 --> 01:10:28,339
こんなにいっぱいの人が わしたちのこと応援してくれてるのじゃ
There are so many people supporting us.

1131
01:10:29,739 --> 01:10:32,339
すごいありがたいことなのじゃ
It's something I'm truly grateful for.

1132
01:10:34,139 --> 01:10:36,739
ありがとうなのじゃ
Thank you so very much.

1133
01:10:38,039 --> 01:10:40,839
ね 濃い一週間じゃの
It really has been an eventful week, hasn't it?

1134
01:10:41,239 --> 01:10:44,139
でも これから先 もっともっとたくさんあるよ
But there is still so much more ahead of us.

1135
01:10:44,639 --> 01:10:49,139
もっともっとたくさん長い間 お主らと一緒にいるよ
I'll be staying with all of you for a much, much longer time.

1136
01:10:53,339 --> 01:10:56,839
うん 応援してくれて嬉しいのじゃ
Yeah. I'm so happy you support me.

1137
01:10:58,639 --> 01:11:00,339
これからも...
From now on, too...

1138
01:11:00,539 --> 01:11:03,639
これからもいっぱい応援してほしいのじゃ！
I hope you'll continue to support me a lot!

1139
01:11:04,039 --> 01:11:07,839
わしたちのこと これからもいっぱい応援してほしいのじゃ！
I hope you'll continue to support all of us a whole lot!

1140
01:11:08,539 --> 01:11:11,139
よろしくお願いしましのじゃ
I'll be counting on you!

1141
01:11:12,439 --> 01:11:14,239
無理だけはしないでね
Just don't push yourselves too hard, okay?

1142
01:11:14,839 --> 01:11:17,539
うん あのね あの 無理しないように
Yeah. So that I don't overwork myself either,

1143
01:11:17,839 --> 01:11:21,939
あの 一週間に1回か2回 ちゃんとお休みも入れますのじゃ
I'll make sure to schedule a day or two off each week.

1144
01:11:22,339 --> 01:11:25,339
結構すでに心配してくれてる人がいる わしのこと
Quite a few people have already been worrying about me.

1145
01:11:26,139 --> 01:11:29,039
「大丈夫かな」って心配してくれてる人いるし
People have been concerned, asking if I'm doing okay,

1146
01:11:29,339 --> 01:11:33,139
わしも慣れるまではね ちゃんとお休みを取りつつも
and until I get used to everything, while taking proper rests...

1147
01:11:33,239 --> 01:11:38,039
長い間ね うん 長い間お主らと一緒にいたいと思ってるから
because I want to be with all of you for a long time,

1148
01:11:38,539 --> 01:11:42,039
お休みをしつつ 配信をしつつ
balancing streaming with taking good breaks,

1149
01:11:44,239 --> 01:11:49,639
お主らと ずっと一緒にいれたらいいなって 思いますのじゃ
I hope we can stay together for a very long time to come.

1150
01:11:54,239 --> 01:11:56,339
ありがとうなのじゃ
Thank you.

1151
01:11:57,139 --> 01:11:58,939
頑張るのじゃ
I'll do my best.

1152
01:12:01,539 --> 01:12:03,939
ありがとうなのじゃ！
Thank you so much!

1153
01:12:04,939 --> 01:12:06,139
よいしょ
Alrighty.

1154
01:12:06,939 --> 01:12:08,839
じゃあ...
Now then...

1155
01:12:09,439 --> 01:12:12,839
お知らせ！お知らせ2個目 ドーン！
An announcement! Announcement number two, ta-da!

1156
01:12:13,739 --> 01:12:18,339
10月の8日日曜日20時から 歌枠をやりますのじゃ！
On Sunday, October 8th starting at 20:00, we'll be holding a singing stream!

1157
01:12:18,739 --> 01:12:22,839
あそびまわり隊 デビュー記念歌枠リレーを行いますのじゃ！
We'll be hosting the Asobi Mawaritai Debut Memorial Singing Stream Relay!

1158
01:12:23,039 --> 01:12:27,139
あそびまわり隊の4人で 歌をね なんか何十分かずつ歌って
The four of us in Asobi Mawaritai will each sing for several tens of minutes,

1159
01:12:27,539 --> 01:12:32,739
最後に4人で歌う 歌枠リレーをやりますのじゃー！
and wrap it up with all four of us singing together in this relay!

1160
01:12:33,339 --> 01:12:36,739
うん 10月8日は 20時から
So please keep your schedules open

1161
01:12:36,739 --> 01:12:41,039
空けといてほしいですのじゃ お願いしますのじゃー！
from 20:00 on October 8th! We're counting on you!

1162
01:12:44,539 --> 01:12:45,839
のじゃ
Yup!

1163
01:12:46,239 --> 01:12:50,339
あとね 明日はね 8番出口で遊ぶのじゃ
Also, tomorrow, I'll be playing The Exit 8!

1164
01:12:50,739 --> 01:12:53,939
ホラゲ？ホラーゲーム？みたい
A horror game? Apparently it's a horror game.

1165
01:12:54,139 --> 01:12:57,739
やったことないから どういうゲームかわかんないけど
I've never played it so I don't really know what kind of game it is,

1166
01:12:58,339 --> 01:13:01,539
異変を見つけるゲームみたいなのじゃ
but it seems to be about spotting anomalies.

1167
01:13:02,639 --> 01:13:04,639
うん あ 一応言っとく
Yeah. Ah, just to be sure, let me mention this.

1168
01:13:04,939 --> 01:13:07,539
配信の最初にも言ったんじゃけど
I mentioned it at the beginning of the stream too, but...

1169
01:13:07,639 --> 01:13:11,339
あの 歌枠はJOYSOUNDさんのカラオケ音源を使わせていただいてるので
Because this singing stream uses karaoke audio from JOYSOUND,

1170
01:13:11,439 --> 01:13:16,039
歌唱部分 お歌歌ってる部分の切り抜きは禁止なのじゃ
clipping the singing portions—where I'm singing songs—is prohibited.

1171
01:13:16,339 --> 01:13:19,239
歌ってるところは動画で切り抜かないで
Please don't clip and post video of the singing parts.

1172
01:13:19,539 --> 01:13:23,739
もしなんか拡散したいなって思ったら URLをツイートするのじゃ URLをツイートして
If you want to spread the word, please tweet the URL instead! Tweet the URL,

1173
01:13:24,039 --> 01:13:28,739
「ここの何分何秒からの〇〇って曲がめっちゃ良かったんだよね」って
and say, "The song at such-and-such time was so amazing!"

1174
01:13:29,139 --> 01:13:30,839
ツイートしてほしいのじゃ
That's how I'd love for you to tweet it.

1175
01:13:31,139 --> 01:13:34,739
で もしツイートしてる人を見かけたら そっとしておいてほしいのじゃ
And if you spot someone tweeting clipped videos, please just leave them be.

1176
01:13:35,339 --> 01:13:40,839
うん あの その辺のね 「ダメだよ」ってのやってる人へ注意するのはね きっと会社の方がね
Warning people who do that and telling them "you can't do that" will be handled by the company,

1177
01:13:41,339 --> 01:13:46,139
やってくださるので そういう人を見つけても何も言わずに静観するのが
so even if you see such people, staying quiet and watching over peacefully

1178
01:13:46,339 --> 01:13:49,639
インターネットリテラシーの高き者！
is the mark of someone with high internet literacy!

1179
01:13:50,339 --> 01:13:54,339
インターリテラシーの高いサラマンダーの...を見ている お主ら メラ組のお主らは
So you folks in the Mela squad who watch this high-literacy salamander,

1180
01:13:54,439 --> 01:13:57,639
そういう人を見ても「シー」なのじゃ
even if you spot someone like that, just go "Shh."

1181
01:13:59,639 --> 01:14:02,539
そして お願いしますのじゃー！
And with that, I'm counting on you!

1182
01:14:05,639 --> 01:14:07,839
ホラーね 苦手
I'm really bad with horror.

1183
01:14:08,239 --> 01:14:10,939
どれぐらい苦手かと言うとね
To give you an idea of how bad I am...

1184
01:14:11,339 --> 01:14:14,339
トースターが怖いくらい苦手
I'm so scared that even toasters terrify me.

1185
01:14:15,339 --> 01:14:18,139
トースターが怖いくらい苦手
I'm terrified to the point where even toasters freak me out.

1186
01:14:18,239 --> 01:14:23,239
トースターでビビっちゃうくらい びっくり系のホラーが苦手じゃから
I get spooked just by toasters popping up, so jump scares are really not my thing.

1187
01:14:23,739 --> 01:14:26,339
ちょっとどうなるか分かんないけど
So I really don't know how it'll go,

1188
01:14:26,339 --> 01:14:28,739
どうなるかなーって思ってるけど
and I'm wondering what will happen,

1189
01:14:31,439 --> 01:14:35,139
まあ 楽しみにしていってほしいのじゃ
but I hope you'll look forward to it.

1190
01:14:36,039 --> 01:14:38,539
頑張りますのじゃ
I'll do my best!

1191
01:14:41,339 --> 01:14:45,139
今日の配信はこの辺でおしまいにしようかな
I think I'll wrap up today's stream around here.

1192
01:14:45,539 --> 01:14:49,339
おしまいにしますのじゃ また明日！また明日会いたいのじゃ！
I'll finish up here. See you tomorrow! I want to see you again tomorrow!

1193
01:14:50,239 --> 01:14:52,139
また明日会いたいのじゃ
I want to see you tomorrow too.

1194
01:14:52,539 --> 01:14:55,439
そして見てくれた人いっぱいコメント あのね あのー
And to everyone who watched and commented lots... You know,

1195
01:14:55,639 --> 01:15:01,786
アーカイブとか 歌枠じゃからアーカイブとか聞いて 「あ この曲のここの部分のメラちゃん好きだな」みたいになったら...
since it's a singing stream, if you listen to the archive and think, "Ah, I love this part of Mela-chan in this song,"...

1196
01:15:02,180 --> 01:15:04,180
あの コメント欄の感想ね
You know, the impressions in the comments section,

1197
01:15:04,180 --> 01:15:05,530
わし見てるからね
I'll be reading them,

1198
01:15:05,530 --> 01:15:07,930
あの「ここが好きなんじゃ」みたいな感じでね
so tell me things like "I like this part"

1199
01:15:07,930 --> 01:15:10,380
あの コメントで教えてくれると
in the comments,

1200
01:15:10,380 --> 01:15:11,780
嬉しいのじゃ
and it'll make me so happy!

1201
01:15:11,980 --> 01:15:13,780
お願いしますなのじゃ
Please do!

1202
01:15:14,280 --> 01:15:14,930
よいしょ
All right.

1203
01:15:14,980 --> 01:15:16,980
たくさん聴いてほしいのじゃ
I hope you'll listen to them a lot!

1204
01:15:17,130 --> 01:15:17,980
のじゃ
Yup!

1205
01:15:18,980 --> 01:15:21,030
じゃあ 最後の挨拶
Now then, for the final farewell,

1206
01:15:21,080 --> 01:15:24,580
「さらばじゃ」でおしまいにしますのじゃ！
let's finish off with "Saraba ja"!

1207
01:15:25,180 --> 01:15:28,680
お主ら 行くぞ？行くぞ？行くぞー！
Everyone, ready? Ready? Here we go!

1208
01:15:29,530 --> 01:15:33,080
今日も配信見てくれてありがとうございましたのじゃ！
Thank you so much for watching the stream today!

1209
01:15:33,230 --> 01:15:34,380
それでは
And with that,

1210
01:15:34,430 --> 01:15:37,980
さらばじゃーー！
farewell!

1211
01:15:41,980 --> 01:15:46,980
ご視聴感謝なのじゃ！
Thanks for watching!

